# Scripts Strategy

## Principle
Load scripts efficiently with minimal impact.

## Guidelines
- Prefer inline scripts for critical functionality
- Use `type="module"` for modern browsers
- Defer non-critical scripts with `async` or `defer`
- Scope scripts to components with `is:inline`
- Avoid global namespace pollution

## Example
```astro
<script>
  // Runs only on client
  console.log('Component mounted');
</script>

<script is:inline>
  // Inline in final HTML
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
</script>
```

## Security
Sanitize dynamic script content. Avoid `innerHTML`.
